{
  "id": "33079_eninaru",
  "headword": "{絵|え}になる",
  "reading": "えになる",
  "romaji": "eninaru",
  "part_of_speech": "expression; verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to be picturesque; to make a good picture",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to be picturesque; to make a good picture; to look striking",
      "explanation": "Of a scene or a person: to look so attractive or fitting that it would make a painting or photograph. Said of landscapes, of people who look good in a setting, and of moments that seem staged by chance."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "33079_eninaru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{絵|え}になる⟦{風景|ふうけい}→風景：03591_fuukei⟧だ。",
      "english": "It's a picturesque view.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33079_eninaru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{何|なに}→何：00498_nani⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦して→する：00392_suru⟧⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧{絵|え}になる。",
      "english": "He looks good whatever he does.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33079_eninaru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{夕日|ゆうひ}→夕日：04080_yuuhi⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{中|なか}→中：00654_naka⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{二人|ふたり}→二人：00622_futari⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{並|なら}んで→並ぶ：00605_narabu⟧⟦{歩|ある}く→歩く：00538_aruku⟧⟦{姿|すがた}→姿：03363_sugata⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧、⟦まるで→まるで：03739_marude⟧⟦{映画|えいが}→映画：02273_eiga⟧⟦のように→のように：30291_noyouni⟧{絵|え}になって⟦いた→いる：00495_iru⟧。",
      "english": "The two of them walking side by side in the sunset made a picture, like a scene from a film.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Intransitive and godan: {絵|え}になる, {絵|え}になった; often {絵|え}になる + noun ({絵|え}になる⟦{二人|ふたり}→二人：00622_futari⟧).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {絵|え}になる⟦{景色|けしき}→景色：01395_keshiki⟧: a picturesque view\n- {絵|え}になる⟦{男|おとこ}→男：00561_otoko⟧/⟦{女|おんな}→女：00559_onna⟧: a person who looks good in any setting\n- ⟦{何|なに}→何：00498_nani⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦して→する：00392_suru⟧⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧{絵|え}になる: to look good whatever one does\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{様|さま}になる→様になる：33066_samaninaru⟧: to look the part — about doing something convincingly, not about beauty\n- ⟦{写真映|しゃしんば}え→写真映え：19246_shashinbae⟧: looking good in photos",
